    <sys:String x:Key="About.Principle1">Keys and recovery phrases are never uploaded to sync services.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="About.Principle2">Verify contact fingerprints through a trusted channel.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="About.Principle3">Local backups omit recovery phrases and chat history.</sys:String>

